{%- comment -%}
  Two different refusals wear the same 403. Someone with no agent record
  cannot reach support at all and needs to be added. An agent who walked
  into an Admin screen has access to support and needs to know it is this
  screen that is closed, not the whole queue.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  function agent = 'modules/support/helpers/current_agent'

  if agent == blank
    assign title = 'modules/support/authorization.forbidden_title' | t
    assign body = 'modules/support/authorization.forbidden_body' | t
  else
    assign title = 'modules/support/authorization.admin_only_title' | t
    assign body = 'modules/support/authorization.admin_only_body' | t
  endif
-%}
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p>{{ body }}</p>
<p><a href="/support">{{ 'modules/support/detail.back' | t }}</a></p>
